<title>SINGAPORE: Sin Soon Huat Ltd net profit up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sin Soon Huat Ltd net profit up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to 31 May 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				9.66   vs   8.99</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			0.01   vs   0.01</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     4.80   vs   5.26</p>
<p>    Turnover				109.88   vs  90.22</p>
<p>    Interest income			 0.71   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    1.35   vs   1.93</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		2.12   vs   1.57</p>
<p>    Profits from associates (loss)    0.02   vs   0.97 (gain)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 14.20   vs  13.61</p>
<p>    Tax					 4.15   vs   4.07</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		     0.40   vs   0.30 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Sin Soon Huat Limited is an industrial welding company. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
